cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using this metadata."
type: software
title: "fof-locomotor-capacity-cohort"
abstract: >-
  Public research software and reproducibility materials for a 12-month cohort
  study of fear of falling and locomotor capacity in older adults. The public
  repository contains synthetic fixtures and structural workflow evidence; it
  does not distribute protected participant-level data or protected analytical
  results.
authors:
